# Title: PowerShell Module File Created
# ID: e36941d0-c0f0-443f-bc6f-cb2952eb69ea
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-05-09
# Tags: attack.persistence
# Description: Detects the creation of a new PowerShell module ".psm1", ".psd1", ".dll", ".ps1", etc.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_path="*\\powershell.exe" OR process_path="*\\pwsh.exe") AND (file_name="*\\WindowsPowerShell\\Modules\\*" OR file_name="*\\PowerShell\\7\\Modules\\*"))
